rong when nobody owns the timeline. Ours is built so nothing falls through the cracks.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start py-8 border-t border-white/14 first:border-t hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors"><div class="md:col-span-1"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.1em] font-mono pt-1.5 block">01</span></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><h3 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-[-0.02em]">Discovery &amp; site visit</h3></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">We visit the site (or review it remotely for pan-India projects), understand how the space will be used, and discuss budget, timelines and must-haves before any design work begins.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start py-8 border-t border-white/14 first:border-t hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors"><div class="md:col-span-1"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.1em] font-mono pt-1.5 block">02</span></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><h3 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-[-0.02em]">Design &amp; 3D visualization</h3></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Layouts, mood boards and detailed renders let you see and approve the design before execution starts.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start py-8 border-t border-white/14 first:border-t hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors"><div class="md:col-span-1"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.1em] font-mono pt-1.5 block">03</span></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><h3 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-[-0.02em]">Material selection &amp; costing</h3></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Every material and finish is selected and costed into a detailed Bill of Quantities, so you know exactly what you&#x27;re paying for before work begins.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start py-8 border-t border-white/14 first:border-t hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors"><div class="md:col-span-1"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.1em] font-mono pt-1.5 block">04</span></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><h3 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-[-0.02em]">Execution &amp; site management</h3></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Civil, electrical, carpentry and finishing work carried out under continuous supervision, with scheduled progress updates.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start py-8 border-t border-white/14 first:border-t hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors"><div class="md:col-span-1"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.1em] font-mono pt-1.5 block">05</span></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><h3 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-[-0.02em]">Handover &amp; styling</h3></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">A defect-check walkthrough followed by final styling — soft furnishings, decor and finishing touches — so the space is ready to move into, not just structurally complete.</p></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/14 pt-10 flex justify-between items-center flex-wrap gap-4"><span class="text-xs text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest">From Concept to Handover</span><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-white hover:text-white/80 transition-colors" href="/process"><span>See Our Full Process</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#141618] text-white py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 border-t border-white/10"><div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-white/45 uppercase block mb-5">More than a design studio — a space partner</span><h3 class="m-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[32px] font-light tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.2] text-white max-w-[760px] text-balance">Anyone can make a space look good in a render. What&#x27;s harder is delivering it on time, on budget, and exactly as designed. That&#x27;s the gap Hause Interiors is built to close.</h3><div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6"><div><span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-white/30 block mb-3">0<!-- -->1</span><h4 class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white leading-snug">Single point of responsibility</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-[1.65]">One team for design and execution, so nothing gets lost between the architect, contractor and carpenter.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6"><div><span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-white/30 block mb-3">0<!-- -->2</span><h4 class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white leading-snug">Transparent, BOQ-based costing</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-[1.65]">You see exactly what you&#x27;re paying for, itemised against a detailed Bill of Quantities, before work begins.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6"><div><span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-white/30 block mb-3">0<!-- -->3</span><h4 class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white leading-snug">Design with a business mindset</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-[1.65]">Born from a digital studio built on measurable outcomes — clear scopes, realistic timelines, and practical budgets.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6"><div><span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-white/30 block mb-3">0<!-- -->4</span><h4 class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white leading-snug">On-ground site supervision</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-[1.65]">Delhi NCR projects are personally supervised at every stage, from civil work to final styling.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6"><div><span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-white/30 block mb-3">0<!-- -->5</span><h4 class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white leading-snug">Pan-India delivery capability</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-[1.65]">Structured remote design paired with vetted local partners, so the same accountability applies anywhere.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-end"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-white hover:text-white/80 transition-colors" href="/why-hause-interiors"><span>Learn More About Why Hause</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="locations" class="bg-[#f9f8f6] text-[#18181b] py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16"><div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-14"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end"><div class="md:col-span-7"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8a8578] uppercase">Where We Work</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px] font-normal tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.12] text-[#18181b] max-w-[560px]">Proudly based in Delhi NCR. Building everywhere.</h2></div><div class="md:col-span-5"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#6b6559] leading-[1.7] max-w-[420px]">Headquartered in Ghaziabad, Hause Interiors designs and delivers homes and workspaces across Delhi, Gurugram, Noida, Ghaziabad and Faridabad — and takes on select residential and commercial projects pan-India, with structured remote design and on-ground execution partners.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-baseline py-6 border-t border-black/12"><div class="md:col-span-4"><span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#18181b]">Delhi</span></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#6b6559] leading-[1.6]">South Delhi apartments to independent floors in older colonies.</p></div><div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-right"><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#a19c8f] font-medium">On ground</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-baseline py-6 border-t border-black/12"><div class="md:col-span-4"><span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#18181b]">Gurugram</span></div><div class="md:col-span-6"><p class="m-0 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#6b6559] leading-[1.6]">High-rise apartments, builder floors and corporate offices.</p></div><div class="md:col-span-2 text-left md:text-right"><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#a19c8f] font-medium">On ground</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-10 items-baseline py-6 border-t border-black/12"><div class="md:col-span-4"><span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#18181b]">Noida &